WEBVTT

00:18:28.849 --> 00:18:32.976
(Applause)

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:34.969
In my very last example --

00:18:34.993 --> 00:18:38.969
I do a lot of my work
using speech recognition software.

00:18:38.993 --> 00:18:41.223
And I'll just --
you have to be kind of quiet

00:18:41.247 --> 00:18:42.850
because the software is nervous.

00:18:43.524 --> 00:18:45.604
Speech recognition
software is really great

00:18:45.628 --> 00:18:48.158
for doing emails very quickly; period.

00:18:48.182 --> 00:18:50.821
Like, I get hundreds of them
a day; period.

00:18:50.845 --> 00:18:54.136
And it's not just what I dictate
that it writes down; period.

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:57.350
I also use this feature
called voice macros; period.

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.102
Correct "dissuade."